---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/speaking-page.css";
import speakingHero from "../assets/speaking-page-hero.jpg";

const formAction = "https://formspree.io/f/xwlpaqpg";
---

<BaseLayout title="Speaking | Dare to Break Free">
  <section class="page-hero speaking-hero" style={`--speaking-hero-image: url("${speakingHero.src}")`}>
    <div class="speaking-hero__copy">
      <p class="speaking-hero__eyebrow"><strong>Speaking about</strong></p>
      <h1>Grit, Resilience &amp; Midlife Reinvention</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="speaking-intro" aria-label="Speaking experience and testimonials">
    <div class="speaking-intro__copy">
      <h2>More than theory</h2>
      <p>I speak from lived experience, years of study in areas such as nutritional science and positive psychology, a huge amount of self-experimentation, and the long process of writing <em>Dare to Break Free</em>.</p>
      <p>That covers a lot of ground, I know, so to help make sense of what I can bring to your audience, these are the themes that sit at the heart of what I talk about.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="speaking-testimonials" aria-label="Audience feedback">
      <blockquote><strong>“Kali has a knack for involving the audience with her confiding style.”</strong></blockquote>
      <blockquote><strong>“Vulnerable, honest, personal storytelling.”</strong></blockquote>
      <blockquote><strong>“Powerful story.”</strong></blockquote>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="speaking-topics" aria-label="Speaking topics">
    <div class="speaking-topics__grid">
      <article class="speaking-topic">
        <h3>Grit</h3>
        <p>Finding that sheer bloody-mindedness to stay with something that matters when progress is slow, motivation disappears and giving up would be a lot easier.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="speaking-topic">
        <h3>Resilience</h3>
        <p>More than just getting through. What actually helps us adapt when life keeps piling it on, and pushing harder isn’t working.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="speaking-topic">
        <h3>Midlife Reinvention</h3>
        <p>When time starts to feel more finite, our energy isn’t what it was, the life we’ve built doesn’t feel as satisfying as we thought it would, and we start asking what we want from the years ahead.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="speaking-audience" aria-label="Audience testimonials">
    <div class="speaking-audience__grid">
      <figure class="speaking-audience__quote">
        <blockquote>“I have listened to Kali’s story twice now and each time her story wells me up inside… She is a speaker who is raw, fresh, authentic with no frills or fakeness, she is just herself. This is what makes her story very powerful and profound indeed.”</blockquote>
        <figcaption><strong>Tosin Ogunnusi</strong><span>The Yes Group Norwich Leadership Team</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="speaking-audience__quote">
        <blockquote>“Kali exuded energy and passion, and it captivated the audience from the first sentence. It was inspirational and urged us all to believe that anyone can change the course of their life.”</blockquote>
        <figcaption><strong>Di Alexander</strong><span>Hamwic Speakers</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="form-section">
    <div>
      <h2>Get in contact</h2>
      <p>If you have something in mind, including something specific from the book, tell me a little about it in the contact form and I’ll get back to you.</p>
    </div>
    <form class="contact-form" action={formAction} method="POST">
      <div class="contact-form__honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
        <label for="contact-website">Leave this field empty</label>
        <input id="contact-website" name="_gotcha" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <label>
        Name
        <input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required />
      </label>
      <label>
        Email
        <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required />
      </label>
      <label>
        Organisation, if relevant
        <input name="organisation" type="text" autocomplete="organization" />
      </label>
      <label>
        What are you planning?
        <textarea name="event" rows="3"></textarea>
      </label>
      <label>
        When is it?
        <input name="event_date" type="text" />
      </label>
      <label>
        Who is the audience?
        <input name="audience" type="text" />
      </label>
      <label>
        What would you like me to speak about?
        <textarea name="speaking_topic" rows="3"></textarea>
      </label>
      <label>
        Anything else I should know?
        <textarea name="additional_information" rows="3"></textarea>
      </label>
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
      <button class="button" type="submit">Send enquiry</button>
    </form>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
